      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(246,243,237,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">From farmhouses off Highway 28 to rural homes out toward the Frenchman Hills, we keep Quincy wells pumping. No water? Call (509) 555-0142 any hour.</p>
